{"id":"m4-200","m":4,"paper":"2019年江西省法检统一考录公务员笔试《行测》题（网友回忆版）","region":"江西","year":2019,"q":10,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"2443975","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"王老师一家有5人，父亲、母亲、妻子、女儿和他本人，今年母亲、王老师和女儿年龄之和为135岁，而且他们三人的年龄正好构成等差数列，那么今年王老师多少岁？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"42"},{"k":"B","t":"45"},{"k":"C","t":"48"},{"k":"D","t":"50"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>本题考查年龄问题，根据题意，“今年母亲、王老师和女儿年龄之和为135岁，而且他们三人的年龄正好构成等差数列”，结合常识王老师的年龄在母亲和女儿之间，即为等差数列的中项。结合等差数列求和公式，前n项之和<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b530dc3b4fd3d372.png\" />，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-94fd25defa0e2374.png\" />，故王老师年龄<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-837699cb90aec8c9.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"2443976","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"甲、乙两公司相距2000米，某日上午8：30小明从甲公司出发到乙公司，小华同时从乙公司出发到甲公司。两人到达对方公司后分别用8分钟时间办事，然后原路返回。假设小明的速度为4km/h，小华的速度为5km/h，则两人第二次相遇的时间是几点？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"9：18"},{"k":"B","t":"9：22"},{"k":"C","t":"9：24"},{"k":"D","t":"9：28"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>本题考查行程问题中的相遇问题。根据题意“小明的速度为4km/h，小华的速度为5km/h”即小明的速度是<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-08652fcc49a0ec99.png\" />米/分钟，小华的速度是<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7abfdb6df8e1b83d.png\" />米/分钟。题中求二人第二次相遇，若不考虑8分钟办事，则两人所走路程和为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-cf6b1ff5f90e42ff.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d5e40ee1c53e2817.png\" />，解得两人第二次相遇需要t=40分钟。考虑8分钟办事时间，两人第二次相遇需要<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6573d37dd639711d.png\" />，故两人第二次相遇时间为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-cfeb87057f7b13c5.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-44eb26cad161eb24.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"2443977","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"现有一条柏油马路需要铺设，甲、乙两施工队合作铺设3天可以完成，而乙施工队单独铺设需要5天完成。如果甲、乙合作铺设1天，乙施工队另有任务，剩余任务由甲单独完成需要多少天？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"4"},{"k":"B","t":"5"},{"k":"C","t":"5.5"},{"k":"D","t":"6"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>本题属于给完工时间型工程问题。根据“甲、乙两施工队合作铺设3天可以完成，而乙施工队单独铺设需要5天完成”，设工作总量为3和5的公倍数15。可知甲乙效率和为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d1f416a56367995f.png\" />，乙效率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-66dbbebc67c70ec9.png\" />，甲效率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5e37c363cebb7bc4.png\" />。如果甲、乙合作铺设1天，可完成工作量为：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0724256e8a6612c2.png\" />，剩余工作量为：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3f2693c6775f71f2.png\" />，由甲单独完成需要<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3b885e3feebc4d5b.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"2443978","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"设袋中装有标着数字为1，2，…，8等8个签，并规定标有数字1，4，7的为中奖号。甲、乙、丙、丁4人依次从袋中随机抽取一个签，已知丙中奖了，则乙不中奖的概率为多少？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"5/8"},{"k":"B","t":"3/7"},{"k":"C","t":"3/8"},{"k":"D","t":"5/7"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>本题考查概率问题，不考虑其他人，丙中奖概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-17531d8bc22aa4bb.png\" />，设此时乙不中奖概率为x，则丙中奖且乙不中奖的概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d8d196e45bf27c51.png\" />；不考虑其他人，由于乙不中奖概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-091517bf49d26951.png\" />，对于丙而言，此时可选签还剩7个，可中奖签还剩3个，中奖概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-99e62bee3d75ab0d.png\" />，则乙不中奖并且丙中奖概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4685c49e0c7578f8.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ae3cd453daddf629.png\" />。故已知丙中奖了，则乙不中奖的概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-34fe3bf3ab89abeb.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"2443979","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某商品的成本比原来增加10%，但是仍保持原售价，致使商品的成本占售价的百分比高达82.5%，那么该商品的利润下降了多少？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"20%"},{"k":"B","t":"25%"},{"k":"C","t":"30%"},{"k":"D","t":"35%"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>赋值售价为100，则成本增加10%后成本为82.5，利润为17.5;原成本为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b0cab76a5427d74c.png\" />，利润为25。故该商品的利润下降了<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d42d6fc5f341aafc.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":6,"qid":"2443989","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>设矩形ABCD，长与宽分别为6米和4米，分别以AB的中点E和顶点A为圆心，3米和4米为半径画圆弧，如图所示，那么两阴影部分的面积之差是多少平方米？</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/16e3a70000c1b17.png\" /></p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"1.87"},{"k":"B","t":"2.69"},{"k":"C","t":"3.49"},{"k":"D","t":"4.42"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据上图，矩形ABCD的面积为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-eb23aab162fe5533.png\" />，以A点为圆心，4米为半径所画圆弧的面积为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-def74e588e95db8e.png\" />，以E点为圆心，3米为半径所画圆弧的面积为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-40719331c1270813.png\" />。代入两集合容斥原理公式：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-49fff10e831de449.png\" />总数-都不，即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fb02be39f8e1917b.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b95c76309aca02fa.png\" />-都不，即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-24c40f494ee6e594.png\" />都不<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-708d8f7d9936819d.png\" />，因<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4a63aff9ca7edf7d.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-24c40f494ee6e594.png\" />都不<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-761e7a56c407974a.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5f1e9716206239bb.png\" />平方米，则两阴影部分的面积之差为2.69平方米。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":7,"qid":"2443990","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"假设某班级共有58人，他们的论文答辩成绩分成优、良、中和不合格四档，其中良的人数是优的3倍少2人，中等的人数是优的2倍，优的人数是不合格的1.5倍，那么这个班论文答辩成绩为良的有多少人？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"25"},{"k":"B","t":"26"},{"k":"C","t":"27"},{"k":"D","t":"28"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意，假设成绩为优的人数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />，则成绩为良的人数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d3c5a5708132c935.png\" />，中等的人数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1160ffc37a9b6750.png\" />，不合格的人数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-62c68ef69f74aac4.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d008665260fca1ef.png\" />，班级共有58人，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d62462d02d0ec053.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-53f8a08e085b9078.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c6aadf685f339c4d.png\" />，解<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-80cf5d44b6f66b00.png\" />，成绩为良的有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-b5db4d108becf83b.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":8,"qid":"2443992","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某园林处计划购进甲、乙两种树苗共1400棵，已知甲树苗每棵4元，乙树苗每棵3元。根据经验可知，甲、乙两种树苗的成活率分别为97%和90%。为了使这批树苗的成活率至少为94%，且购买成本最小，那么购进甲、乙两种树苗的最小费用是多少元？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"4850"},{"k":"B","t":"4800"},{"k":"C","t":"5050"},{"k":"D","t":"5000"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>假设购进甲、乙两种树苗数量分别为x、y棵，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-80479252cda5100c.png\" />，因这批树苗的成活率至少为94%，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-99b8fb7b3eb0eac0.png\" />，即<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2807feab621db139.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-dcc9fb4ce1ab7364.png\" />。</p><p>因甲树苗单价高于乙，在保证成活率至少为94%的前提下，购进甲树苗数量越少，总费用越低。取<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-334cfc44232c3c01.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6fa4472692539cb0.png\" />，则总费用最少为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6cf441b8b5edfd8b.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":9,"qid":"2443993","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某高校计划招聘81名博士，拟分配到13个不同的院系，假定院系A分得的博士人数比其他院系都多，那么院系A分得的博士人数至少有多少名？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"6"},{"k":"B","t":"7"},{"k":"C","t":"8"},{"k":"D","t":"9"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意，假设院系A分得的博士人数为x，要想x尽可能小，则其他院系分得的人数应尽可能多，最多为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-db62f6a43bef9d4b.png\" />。因共有81名博士，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-415e01fcf6d56f65.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e9f681d428f9e526.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-339e93fe0327d16b.png\" />，则院系A分得的博士人数至少有8名。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":10,"qid":"2443994","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"从下列四个选项中选取一项填入括号中，使数列1，3，5，11，21，（  ），85形成一定的规律。","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"38"},{"k":"B","t":"40"},{"k":"C","t":"42"},{"k":"D","t":"43"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>观察可发现，数列中后一项大约为前一项的2倍，因此考虑前一项2倍之后和后一项的关系。<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-43aa109f5ae3346e.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3994c46d356b0447.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2aa3fcc107646a78.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d4ac1a7091015ad0.png\" />，修正项依次为+1，-1，+1，-1，则题目所求项为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-698977373291fdfd.png\" />，验证可得，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-60ca092bf7afa770.png\" />，满足。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"}]}]}